1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:01:32,890 --> 00:01:34,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

3
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:41,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As of late, Genau here
has been without a companion.</b></font>

4
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:44,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His partner was killed
in battle.</b></font>

5
00:01:44,060 --> 00:01:45,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You shall replace him,</b></font>

6
00:01:45,270 --> 00:01:47,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and slay demons
with Genau up north.</b></font>

7
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:52,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm eager to work with you.
It's an honor.</b></font>

8
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:55,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The north is deadly.</b></font>

9
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:59,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As illustrated by my partner,
loss of life is common.</b></font>

10
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:01,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do not cost me mine.</b></font>

11
00:02:05,710 --> 00:02:07,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shake her hand.</b></font>

12
00:02:15,550 --> 00:02:17,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[pigeons cooing]</b></font>

13
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
Methode, do you believe</b></font>

14
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that you're a good person
at your core?</b></font>

15
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:29,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] I'm not sure
that I understand what you mean.</b></font>

16
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:33,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My previous partner
was a good person,</b></font>

17
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:36,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the exact opposite of me.</b></font>

18
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:40,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He would risk body and mind
for complete strangers</b></font>

19
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without a second thought.</b></font>

20
00:02:41,620 --> 00:02:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

21
00:02:46,330 --> 00:02:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was so boisterous,
so full of smiles.</b></font>

22
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He treated me as you would
an old friend.</b></font>

23
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wherever we went,</b></font>

24
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:59,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>people were drawn
to his magnetic personality.</b></font>

25
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:07,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was a fool.</b></font>

26
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exclaims softly]</b></font>

27
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:11,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

28
00:03:20,410 --> 00:03:23,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He rescued a child
at the cost of his life.</b></font>

29
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:28,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And at the cost
of slaying the demon.</b></font>

30
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:32,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His decision was foolish
and reckless,</b></font>

31
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:34,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I would never have done
the same.</b></font>

32
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:38,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What is one more life forsaken?</b></font>

33
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:42,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All I can think to say is,
"Why me?"</b></font>

34
00:03:43,970 --> 00:03:45,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you mean?</b></font>

35
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why was I chosen
to work with you?</b></font>

36
00:03:48,810 --> 00:03:50,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have no idea.</b></font>

37
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:52,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was
Mistress Serie's ruling.</b></font>

38
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've noticed a key similarity</b></font>

39
00:03:57,490 --> 00:03:59,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the first-class mages
who get dispatched</b></font>

40
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the Northern Plateau.</b></font>

41
00:04:02,370 --> 00:04:05,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Most crave violence
like water or air.</b></font>

42
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I agree, you're an odd choice.</b></font>

43
00:04:10,670 --> 00:04:13,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Übel would've been a better fit
for the typical mold.</b></font>

44
00:04:15,210 --> 00:04:16,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It doesn't matter.</b></font>

45
00:04:16,670 --> 00:04:19,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No decent person
harbors desire for bloodshed.</b></font>

46
00:04:21,050 --> 00:04:24,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whatever you do,
do not end up like me.</b></font>

47
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:27,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[fire crackling]</b></font>

48
00:04:30,650 --> 00:04:33,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Let's go over
the information we've compiled</b></font>

49
00:04:33,150 --> 00:04:35,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before we begin our search.</b></font>

50
00:04:35,650 --> 00:04:36,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Very well.</b></font>

51
00:04:37,150 --> 00:04:39,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Based on traces of mana
and the variety of damage dealt,</b></font>

52
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:41,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we can conclude</b></font>

53
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>four primary demons
led the attack.</b></font>

54
00:04:43,450 --> 00:04:46,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All four of them have vanished
from the area.</b></font>

55
00:04:46,330 --> 00:04:48,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's almost one
for each of us.</b></font>

56
00:04:49,410 --> 00:04:52,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the strongest of the unit
is a demon general.</b></font>

57
00:04:52,710 --> 00:04:54,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It wields four swords.</b></font>

58
00:04:54,210 --> 00:04:55,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's how
it killed the knights.</b></font>

59
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:02,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What makes
a demon general special?</b></font>

60
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:05,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They are demon warriors
of the highest caliber.</b></font>

61
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Their fighting style involves</b></font>

62
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>enhancing their
physical capabilities</b></font>

63
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with powerful magic.</b></font>

64
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:12,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They can be quite devoted
to their craft,</b></font>

65
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:15,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>unafraid to spend centuries
mastering their martial skills.</b></font>

66
00:05:15,730 --> 00:05:18,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There were generals
in the Demon King's army</b></font>

67
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:19,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that made Eisen
look like a beginner.</b></font>

68
00:05:19,990 --> 00:05:21,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're kidding me.</b></font>

69
00:05:21,910 --> 00:05:24,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is hardly a joking matter.
Keep in mind,</b></font>

70
00:05:24,450 --> 00:05:27,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it is likely the beast's
appearance is far from human.</b></font>

71
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:30,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You say that like it's gonna
make things even worse.</b></font>

72
00:05:30,790 --> 00:05:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you ever fought a swordsman</b></font>

73
00:05:32,370 --> 00:05:35,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who's trained for lifetimes
and wields four swords at once?</b></font>

74
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't say that I have.</b></font>

75
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:39,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The same is true for me.</b></font>

76
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:40,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it was true
for those knights</b></font>

77
00:05:40,970 --> 00:05:42,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until they met their end.</b></font>

78
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

79
00:05:49,810 --> 00:05:51,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JUNG] Lord Revolte.</b></font>

80
00:05:52,770 --> 00:05:55,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fresh prey
is squirming around in our net.</b></font>

81
00:05:55,350 --> 00:05:57,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A tasty meal rich in mana.</b></font>

82
00:05:58,070 --> 00:06:00,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've got one warrior
and four mages,</b></font>

83
00:06:00,610 --> 00:06:02,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and three of them
are first-class.</b></font>

84
00:06:04,410 --> 00:06:07,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have no doubt
we can handle that many.</b></font>

85
00:06:07,330 --> 00:06:08,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall we make a move?</b></font>

86
00:06:09,490 --> 00:06:10,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] No.</b></font>

87
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:13,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They are stronger
than you suggest.</b></font>

88
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:15,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We will wait for them
to split up.</b></font>

89
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JUNG] Do you think they would
do that, Lord Revolte?</b></font>

90
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:21,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>From what I can tell,
they seem rather guarded.</b></font>

91
00:06:23,590 --> 00:06:25,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE]
I am certain of it.</b></font>

92
00:06:30,470 --> 00:06:32,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The time we spent
slaughtering the villagers</b></font>

93
00:06:32,810 --> 00:06:34,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is about to pay off.</b></font>

94
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There is a common theme.</b></font>

95
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A fatal flaw shared by many men</b></font>

96
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we have encountered
on our path of destruction.</b></font>

97
00:06:42,030 --> 00:06:43,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Know what it is?</b></font>

98
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, now you have to tell me,
my lord.</b></font>

99
00:06:45,780 --> 00:06:46,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

100
00:06:49,330 --> 00:06:52,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Let the hunt begin.
We're as ready as we'll ever be.</b></font>

101
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our first stop should be
the abandoned fort</b></font>

102
00:06:55,290 --> 00:06:57,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you told us about up north.</b></font>

103
00:06:57,330 --> 00:06:58,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a strong lead.</b></font>

104
00:06:58,420 --> 00:06:59,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In my experience,</b></font>

105
00:06:59,590 --> 00:07:02,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>demons often hole up
in places like that.</b></font>

106
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:05,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Wait.</b></font>

107
00:07:06,470 --> 00:07:09,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Chivalric Order of Norm
will come for the bodies.</b></font>

108
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:11,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone should see
to their safety.</b></font>

109
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll remain behind.</b></font>

110
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:18,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Humans have a curious habit
of remaining in villages</b></font>

111
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to protect the corpses
of their fallen.</b></font>

112
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

113
00:07:21,650 --> 00:07:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's curious indeed.
So why do they do it?</b></font>

114
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] We don't need
to know the reason.</b></font>

115
00:07:27,410 --> 00:07:29,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JUNG]
Huh. But it's so interesting.</b></font>

116
00:07:29,910 --> 00:07:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd love to spend just a moment
in their minds.</b></font>

117
00:07:32,910 --> 00:07:35,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] Sounds like
a rather dull place to me.</b></font>

118
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are very strange.</b></font>

119
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:40,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Humans are so volatile.</b></font>

120
00:07:40,290 --> 00:07:41,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They'll behave
with perfect reason</b></font>

121
00:07:41,670 --> 00:07:43,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and then toss it all
to the wind.</b></font>

122
00:07:43,130 --> 00:07:45,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you want to know why
they can be so irrational?</b></font>

123
00:07:46,220 --> 00:07:48,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE]
That is simply how they are.</b></font>

124
00:07:48,180 --> 00:07:49,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing more to it.</b></font>

125
00:07:49,970 --> 00:07:52,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am not interested
in questions of "why."</b></font>

126
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though, there is one.</b></font>

127
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:58,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>An eccentric demon
who has made it his life's work</b></font>

128
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:01,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to study the whims of mankind.</b></font>

129
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's really
someone like that?</b></font>

130
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:06,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's amazing! You have
to tell me more about them.</b></font>

131
00:08:07,150 --> 00:08:09,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only if you
make yourself useful.</b></font>

132
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:11,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JUNG] Is that a yes?</b></font>

133
00:08:11,910 --> 00:08:14,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You owe me now, Lord Revolte.
I won't forget!</b></font>

134
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
You'll stay here by yourself?</b></font>

135
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
It shouldn't be much longer</b></font>

136
00:08:19,710 --> 00:08:20,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before they arrive.</b></font>

137
00:08:21,710 --> 00:08:22,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll meet up with you</b></font>

138
00:08:22,790 --> 00:08:24,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>once the bodies
have been collected</b></font>

139
00:08:24,380 --> 00:08:26,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the Order is on their way.</b></font>

140
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Until then.</b></font>

141
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:36,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should hang back with you.</b></font>

142
00:08:37,430 --> 00:08:39,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you know
how foolish you sound?</b></font>

143
00:08:39,730 --> 00:08:42,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your party is on the path
to challenge a skilled foe.</b></font>

144
00:08:42,770 --> 00:08:44,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They will require a frontliner.</b></font>

145
00:08:44,610 --> 00:08:46,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe, but you'll need one too.</b></font>

146
00:08:46,610 --> 00:08:49,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if the demons use this
as their chance to return?</b></font>

147
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:50,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not an issue.</b></font>

148
00:08:50,950 --> 00:08:53,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am perfectly capable
of defending myself</b></font>

149
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without help from you.</b></font>

150
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:57,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Trust me.
So are Frieren than the others.</b></font>

151
00:08:57,410 --> 00:08:59,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps, but only to a point.</b></font>

152
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Yeah, I hear you.</b></font>

153
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:02,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if things get bad,
can't you just run away?</b></font>

154
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:03,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose so.</b></font>

155
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:05,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't have that choice.</b></font>

156
00:09:05,710 --> 00:09:07,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no shot
you abandon the village.</b></font>

157
00:09:08,010 --> 00:09:09,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

158
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:13,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They are dead.
There's no one left to abandon.</b></font>

159
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you felt that way,</b></font>

160
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:17,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then you wouldn't stay here
to protect their bodies.</b></font>

161
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:21,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau sighs] Suit yourself.</b></font>

162
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:24,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

163
00:09:24,310 --> 00:09:26,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

164
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:39,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're a fool,
but you're a good person, Stark.</b></font>

165
00:09:39,290 --> 00:09:40,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

166
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:42,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] I've known
several people like you.</b></font>

167
00:09:43,330 --> 00:09:45,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They tend to lead short lives.</b></font>

168
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] For what it's worth,</b></font>

169
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you seem like a good person
to me, too.</b></font>

170
00:09:52,010 --> 00:09:53,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

171
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:56,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're still trying
to defend the village</b></font>

172
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even after it's been destroyed.</b></font>

173
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:00,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I couldn't do that.</b></font>

174
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:09,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] I assure you,
I'm not a good person.</b></font>

175
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quite the opposite, really.</b></font>

176
00:10:14,070 --> 00:10:15,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My sole priority for some time</b></font>

177
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:18,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has been bringing peace
to the northern lands.</b></font>

178
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:21,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've killed and forsaken many
in my pursuit,</b></font>

179
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:23,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>all with a resounding numbness.</b></font>

180
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:27,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps this is what I deserve.</b></font>

181
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:30,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Death has become
a regular part of my day.</b></font>

182
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:35,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel no tinge of sadness.</b></font>

183
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My hometown is in ruins,
yet I cannot shed a tear.</b></font>

184
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:42,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There was no tug on my soul
to protect the village.</b></font>

185
00:10:42,390 --> 00:10:44,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Staying back seemed
the proper thing to do.</b></font>

186
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no undoing the hurt
I've caused,</b></font>

187
00:10:49,730 --> 00:10:53,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>yet I am wasting energy
in some desperate attempt.</b></font>

188
00:10:57,870 --> 00:10:59,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, Stark,</b></font>

189
00:10:59,990 --> 00:11:01,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>dangerous as it is,</b></font>

190
00:11:01,290 --> 00:11:03,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there are many who call
this plateau their home.</b></font>

191
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Going forward,</b></font>

192
00:11:15,010 --> 00:11:17,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we should avoid
using long-range detection.</b></font>

193
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they're skilled,</b></font>

194
00:11:18,890 --> 00:11:20,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they'll quickly trace it
back to us.</b></font>

195
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:21,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Right.</b></font>

196
00:11:22,350 --> 00:11:23,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though caution's key,</b></font>

197
00:11:23,810 --> 00:11:26,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we still have a while to go
before we reach the fort.</b></font>

198
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:28,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The demons won't notice
a little chat.</b></font>

199
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode chuckles]</b></font>

200
00:11:29,810 --> 00:11:31,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're sure it's worth the risk?</b></font>

201
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:34,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll be more fluid in battle
if tensions are low.</b></font>

202
00:11:36,950 --> 00:11:38,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not a solitary care.</b></font>

203
00:11:41,410 --> 00:11:43,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Good communication
is the foundation</b></font>

204
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:45,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>upon which one can build a team.</b></font>

205
00:11:45,870 --> 00:11:47,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ponder that, young lady.</b></font>

206
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:48,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Uh-huh.</b></font>

207
00:11:49,210 --> 00:11:51,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then, in the spirit of openness,</b></font>

208
00:11:51,130 --> 00:11:53,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>may I inquire about
a quick head pat?</b></font>

209
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:56,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I can't believe you
said that with a straight face.</b></font>

210
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:58,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My trouble is,
I have an innate desire</b></font>

211
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:01,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to coddle and cuddle
adorable creatures.</b></font>

212
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:04,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But dear Mistress Serie
is scarcely one to capitulate.</b></font>

213
00:12:05,390 --> 00:12:07,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And in the rare instance
she agrees,</b></font>

214
00:12:07,230 --> 00:12:09,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she looks horribly displeased.</b></font>

215
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:11,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
I fear I would look the same.</b></font>

216
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If age plays into this,</b></font>

217
00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:16,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>know that I am your elder
by many a century.</b></font>

218
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:18,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides, my head
is not for patting.</b></font>

219
00:12:18,450 --> 00:12:21,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's right. She may be cute,
but she's a mature adult.</b></font>

220
00:12:21,660 --> 00:12:23,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Petting is out of the question.</b></font>

221
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miss Frieren.</b></font>

222
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This grimoire contains a spell</b></font>

223
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:33,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that prevents any shell
from falling in the bowl</b></font>

224
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:34,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when you're cracking eggs.</b></font>

225
00:12:35,590 --> 00:12:37,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pet me to your heart's content.</b></font>

226
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:38,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren!</b></font>

227
00:12:38,970 --> 00:12:40,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

228
00:12:41,430 --> 00:12:44,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode chuckles, hums]</b></font>

229
00:12:45,850 --> 00:12:47,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you
for being a good sport.</b></font>

230
00:12:47,350 --> 00:12:49,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I rarely get to indulge
for long stretches.</b></font>

231
00:12:50,020 --> 00:12:52,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're allowed ten minutes a day
and not a second more.</b></font>

232
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:54,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's all?</b></font>

233
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

234
00:13:01,950 --> 00:13:03,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Final question, Miss Frieren.</b></font>

235
00:13:03,990 --> 00:13:07,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Before we locate the enemy,
may I please give you a hug?</b></font>

236
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Serie
has always denied my requests.</b></font>

237
00:13:10,290 --> 00:13:11,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can do whatever you want.</b></font>

238
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:13,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
Adorable and generous.</b></font>

239
00:13:16,210 --> 00:13:17,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern groans softly]</b></font>

240
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern grunts softly]</b></font>

241
00:13:22,590 --> 00:13:25,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Fern. Stand down.</b></font>

242
00:13:26,810 --> 00:13:29,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey! Stop that!</b></font>

243
00:13:30,850 --> 00:13:33,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm of no use to you
split in two.</b></font>

244
00:13:39,070 --> 00:13:40,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was that them?</b></font>

245
00:13:40,490 --> 00:13:42,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They've picked out
exactly where we are.</b></font>

246
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:45,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This battle's begun
whether we're ready or not.</b></font>

247
00:13:45,620 --> 00:13:47,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Typical demons.</b></font>

248
00:13:47,830 --> 00:13:50,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're bloodthirsty
and unafraid.</b></font>

249
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:51,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they can tell where we are,</b></font>

250
00:13:51,830 --> 00:13:54,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they can also tell
that we're powerful mages.</b></font>

251
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:56,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And they're wholly unfazed.</b></font>

252
00:13:59,090 --> 00:14:00,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They have noticed us.</b></font>

253
00:14:01,420 --> 00:14:03,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right. Shall we begin?</b></font>

254
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:09,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nebeladora.</b></font>

255
00:14:14,730 --> 00:14:16,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It's a fog made of mana.</b></font>

256
00:14:16,770 --> 00:14:19,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're blocking our vision
and our mana detection.</b></font>

257
00:14:33,370 --> 00:14:35,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our separation
was surely intentional.</b></font>

258
00:14:36,170 --> 00:14:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're quite skilled.</b></font>

259
00:14:42,260 --> 00:14:43,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Choose your foe.</b></font>

260
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:45,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would like the tallest one.</b></font>

261
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:47,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a peculiar aura
about her.</b></font>

262
00:14:47,930 --> 00:14:49,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She should be fun.</b></font>

263
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:54,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that leaves the other two
to me.</b></font>

264
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:59,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Remain on high alert
for attacks from above.</b></font>

265
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:02,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Mistress Frieren?
-Yes, Fern.</b></font>

266
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:05,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Both of those demons
were flying.</b></font>

267
00:15:05,860 --> 00:15:08,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The demons we've fought before
could fly, too.</b></font>

268
00:15:08,870 --> 00:15:10,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're using flying magic,
right?</b></font>

269
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:12,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have explained this.</b></font>

270
00:15:13,330 --> 00:15:17,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Until just forty years ago,
demons ruled the skies.</b></font>

271
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:20,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those talents have not dwindled.</b></font>

272
00:15:20,630 --> 00:15:24,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure, but you also said demons
only study one type of magic.</b></font>

273
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you think of walking</b></font>

274
00:15:27,010 --> 00:15:29,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as a special,
attention-demanding ability?</b></font>

275
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the same principle.</b></font>

276
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Flying is so second nature
to them.</b></font>

277
00:15:34,930 --> 00:15:36,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It isn't magic anymore.</b></font>

278
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:38,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When fighting a demon,</b></font>

279
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:41,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's safe to assume
they will use the skies.</b></font>

280
00:15:42,780 --> 00:15:43,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had a feeling</b></font>

281
00:15:44,030 --> 00:15:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>our opponents would be
accustomed to battle.</b></font>

282
00:15:46,150 --> 00:15:47,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're as comfortable</b></font>

283
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:49,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as members
of the Demon King's army.</b></font>

284
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:51,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[loud slashing]
-[Fern gasps]</b></font>

285
00:15:55,870 --> 00:15:57,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

286
00:16:01,250 --> 00:16:03,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our cuddler has engaged
the enemy.</b></font>

287
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:06,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ready?
I'll leave this fight to you.</b></font>

288
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You won't help?</b></font>

289
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As I recall,</b></font>

290
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:11,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this job was assigned
to three first-class mages.</b></font>

291
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:14,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you are
the only first-class mage I see.</b></font>

292
00:16:15,430 --> 00:16:17,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is now really
a good time for that?</b></font>

293
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:20,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's as good of a time as any.</b></font>

294
00:16:20,350 --> 00:16:21,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can defeat it.</b></font>

295
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:23,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern gasps]</b></font>

296
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Told you.</b></font>

297
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:33,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh?</b></font>

298
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know that was a fluke.</b></font>

299
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:41,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I only reacted in time
because you pointed it out.</b></font>

300
00:16:42,290 --> 00:16:44,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I couldn't detect the attack
at all.</b></font>

301
00:16:50,050 --> 00:16:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm severely outclassed.</b></font>

302
00:16:51,930 --> 00:16:54,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to disagree
with you on that.</b></font>

303
00:16:54,890 --> 00:16:56,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of the first-class mages
I've met,</b></font>

304
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:59,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>few are as dedicated
to the fundamentals as you.</b></font>

305
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:04,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You trust me.
And I say you can win this.</b></font>

306
00:17:05,150 --> 00:17:07,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Fern grunts softly]
-[wind blows]</b></font>

307
00:17:14,780 --> 00:17:18,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I caught some fish.
Want a late night snack?</b></font>

308
00:17:19,210 --> 00:17:22,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] I should pass.
Methode would be angry with me.</b></font>

309
00:17:22,630 --> 00:17:25,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She says it's unhealthy
to eat late at night.</b></font>

310
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:27,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
Oh, yeah? More for me then.</b></font>

311
00:17:29,050 --> 00:17:30,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[soft clattering]</b></font>

312
00:17:32,090 --> 00:17:35,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love eating midnight snacks,
but I've gotta be sneaky.</b></font>

313
00:17:35,100 --> 00:17:36,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

314
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Swear you won't tell on me
to Fern?</b></font>

315
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:42,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine.</b></font>

316
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:50,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems we're fighting
many of the same demons.</b></font>

317
00:17:55,660 --> 00:17:57,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hey, Genau?</b></font>

318
00:17:57,990 --> 00:17:59,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know the demon</b></font>

319
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:01,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who attacked this village,
don't you?</b></font>

320
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:03,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Demons that fight
with four swords</b></font>

321
00:18:03,710 --> 00:18:05,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are hardly common.</b></font>

322
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:09,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Divine Revolte</b></font>

323
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:12,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is the demon who ended
my partner's life.</b></font>

324
00:18:15,050 --> 00:18:17,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure he's strong,
but that name's a bit much.</b></font>

325
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:20,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] It comes
from the four swords</b></font>

326
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he created using magic.</b></font>

327
00:18:23,730 --> 00:18:25,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He can freely change
their weight.</b></font>

328
00:18:26,020 --> 00:18:28,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sometimes, they're as light
as feathers.</b></font>

329
00:18:28,270 --> 00:18:31,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Other times, they are
heavy boulders waiting to fall.</b></font>

330
00:18:31,570 --> 00:18:34,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The unknown is
what makes them so dangerous.</b></font>

331
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:37,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're called
the Divine Cleaving Swords</b></font>

332
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:39,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after the famous blade
that split mountains</b></font>

333
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>during mythical times.</b></font>

334
00:18:41,870 --> 00:18:43,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He can change them
to win every fight.</b></font>

335
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:46,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Light and sharp
or heavy and destructive.</b></font>

336
00:18:47,210 --> 00:18:49,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And every shade in between.</b></font>

337
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:51,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Magic creates objects</b></font>

338
00:18:51,670 --> 00:18:54,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that have no business
existing in this world.</b></font>

339
00:18:55,050 --> 00:18:57,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It can take an eon
of murderous intent</b></font>

340
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:59,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and give it a physical form
in a weapon.</b></font>

341
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:03,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Demons create these armaments
to kill humans by the score.</b></font>

342
00:19:04,730 --> 00:19:07,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Far more than necessary
for their sustenance,</b></font>

343
00:19:07,610 --> 00:19:09,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as if to test their new toys.</b></font>

344
00:19:12,070 --> 00:19:13,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

345
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:15,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stark.</b></font>

346
00:19:16,910 --> 00:19:19,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Glad I hung back, aren't you?</b></font>

347
00:19:23,370 --> 00:19:24,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's quite fast.</b></font>

348
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Brace yourself.</b></font>

349
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:32,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rumbling]</b></font>

350
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:40,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

351
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:54,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

352
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's four swords.</b></font>

353
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One warrior
and one first-class mage</b></font>

354
00:20:03,740 --> 00:20:05,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>left behind as guards.</b></font>

355
00:20:05,290 --> 00:20:07,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was
a foolishly human decision.</b></font>

356
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:09,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So predictable.</b></font>

357
00:20:10,130 --> 00:20:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's Revolte.</b></font>

358
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:13,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I had a feeling.</b></font>

359
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:16,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose there is no need
to introduce myself.</b></font>

360
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:19,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The warrior is someone new.</b></font>

361
00:20:19,090 --> 00:20:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you look rather familiar
to me, first-class mage.</b></font>

362
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:24,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who are you?</b></font>

363
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:26,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No point in waiting around.</b></font>

364
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:29,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you can, avoid taking
his attacks head on.</b></font>

365
00:20:29,730 --> 00:20:30,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If he feels compelled,</b></font>

366
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:33,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he could flatten you
in a single blow.</b></font>

367
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:36,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I asked who you are, mage.
Tell me.</b></font>

368
00:20:36,690 --> 00:20:39,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I do not talk to pests
before I exterminate them.</b></font>

369
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:42,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see no good reason
to declare my name.</b></font>

370
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:46,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I do not appreciate
being belittled to a pest.</b></font>

371
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:50,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We both speak the same language
and know the same words.</b></font>

372
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:53,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if you refuse to use them,</b></font>

373
00:20:53,630 --> 00:20:56,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose there are simpler ways
we can communicate.</b></font>

374
00:20:59,130 --> 00:21:01,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I, too, shall exterminate
the pests</b></font>

375
00:21:01,930 --> 00:21:03,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that stand before me.</b></font>

376
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:07,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I can't take
his attacks head on,</b></font>

377
00:21:07,270 --> 00:21:08,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then what should I do?</b></font>

378
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:11,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A skilled warrior can
deflect blows, can he not?</b></font>

379
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:17,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts] I mean, yeah, but...</b></font>

380
00:21:28,750 --> 00:21:30,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I can't protect you!</b></font>

381
00:21:30,410 --> 00:21:33,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can assure you,
I don't need protecting.</b></font>

382
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:36,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Close-quarters combat
is actually a specialty of mine.</b></font>

383
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:39,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

384
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:41,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

385
00:21:49,230 --> 00:21:50,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau grunts]</b></font>

386
00:21:56,980 --> 00:21:58,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His magic and mine
are not as different</b></font>

387
00:21:59,030 --> 00:22:00,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as you might suspect.</b></font>

388
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:03,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can also create objects
that shouldn't exist.</b></font>

389
00:22:04,530 --> 00:22:06,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, Digardnacht.</b></font>

390
00:22:11,120 --> 00:22:15,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A nameless mage with a spell
to manipulate niello wings.</b></font>

391
00:22:16,590 --> 00:22:18,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Interesting.</b></font>

392
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:19,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

393
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:22,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

394
00:23:49,970 --> 00:23:51,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It's nice to watch from afar.</b></font>

395
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:53,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] I cannot find
the slightest opening.</b></font>

396
00:23:53,890 --> 00:23:55,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[JUNG] I did it!
-[overlapping chatter]</b></font>

397
00:23:55,770 --> 00:23:57,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] I shall put you
out of your misery.</b></font>

398
00:23:58,020 --> 00:23:59,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
He met a magnificent end.</b></font>

